amount of data of diverse types

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.300
and then process a
huge amount of it.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.750
The second part is often
then after you have that,

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.490
not having the
tools and skill set

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.410
necessary to prepare
the data so you actually

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:41.330
